    "raw": "Day by day, Dreadwing grew more apoplectic as the number of Glitch never grew. In fact, his anger was such that he took to hurling his subjects from the castle tower, thus causing the population to shrink rather than grow. This made him even more angry.",
    "value": "骇翼日复一日，见子民之数未尝增，怒意愈炽。其愤懑之甚，竟将臣民自城堡高塔投掷而下，以致人口不增反减。此举令其怒火更甚。"
