    "raw": "One day, a group of Glitch scientists hit upon an idea. They had no idea how to create more of their number, of course, but they were rather adept at making stylish suits of armour. It had often been remarked upon how the armour looked like the Glitch themselves, and so they set to work commissioning a number of blacksmiths to make as many suits of armour as possible.",
    "value": "一日，数位电子人匠师忽生一计。彼等虽不知如何增殖同类，然于打造精美甲胄之术，却颇为娴熟。世人尝言此等甲胄形似电子人本身，故彼等遂命铁匠广造甲胄，多多益善。"
